          Is PDF Merge Safe?
        </h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          This implementation processes PDF files locally inside your browser. No network request carrying your PDF data is made by the tool. The server delivers the static page and JavaScript assets only — it has no visibility into the files you select or the content of those files.
        </p>
        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl border border-emerald-200 dark:border-emerald-800/60 bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-emerald-950/20 space-y-2">
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-emerald-800 dark:text-emerald-300">What this tool does NOT do:</h3>
          <ul class="text-xs text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400 space-y-1 list-disc list-inside leading-relaxed">
            <li>Upload PDF files to any server or cloud service</li>
            <li>Store PDF content in cookies, localStorage, or a database</li>
            <li>Send file data to analytics platforms</li>
            <li>Transmit file names or sizes as identifying information</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <p class="leading-relaxed text-sm">
          If you are working with sensitive or confidential documents, a client-side tool of this kind is preferable to services that require uploading files to a remote server.
        </p>
